{"id":"5e705f7962c302c2","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-godel-number.md","title":"Gödel Number","display":"df-godel-number — Gödel Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-godel-number","aliases":["90-df-godel-number"],"display":"df-godel-number — Gödel Number","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-godel-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-godel-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-number — Gödel Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Syn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Syn}\\)</span> (effectively presented syntactic domain)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathrm{Syn}\">\\(E\\in\\mathrm{Syn}\\)</span> (syntactic expression)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering with partial decoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>无下标角码使用本文件已固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>；下式定义这一短写，不为每次出现重新选择编码。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner_g:\\mathrm{Syn}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\n\\quad\n\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(E)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner_g:\\mathrm{Syn}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N,\n\\quad\n\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(E)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner E\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner E\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g\">\\(\\ulcorner E\\urcorner_g\\)</span> 与无下标短写均使用正文固定的同一个编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。代码为元语言自然数；在对象公式中使用它时，应先由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a> 形成数码。任意固定的有效 Gödel 编号不被强加某个逻辑符号的具体数值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering with partial decoder, see [